  "limitations": [
    "display_panel_read_id, the panel probe and the DCS command-table player execute in an emulator over authored state; the DCS read/write transfers, the delay and the logger are supplied. The transfer stub captures the command bytes the code emits and injects scripted response bytes, so the DCS framing and the 24-bit id accumulation are verified, but no panel or bus is driven.",
    "The panel table is authored with the nine real ICNA3311 variant ids read from the firmware; the probe selects by a full 24-bit id match. The actual device id, the full power/reset/ESD bring-up in 0x702c8c70, the real init command tables and the physical bus (device op behind +0xc/+0x10) are not executed here.",
    "Panel timing, electrical bring-up, the framebuffer/refresh path and backlight hardware remain unproved and need the device. This is a driver contract, not a working display driver."
  ],
